
Key Levelz (CSV/URL Levels)
`KeyLevelz` can draw chart levels from either:
	•	`CSV File Path` (local file, example: `C:\NinjaTrader\KeyLevels.csv`)
	•	`CSV URL (optional)` (web-hosted CSV, example: `https://example.com/keylevels.csv`)

Where to set it in NinjaTrader:
	1.	Open your chart.
	2.	Right-click → Indicators.
	3.	Select `Key Levelz`.
	4.	In **Parameters**, set either `CSV File Path` or `CSV URL (optional)`.
	5.	Click OK.

If both are set, `CSV URL (optional)` is used first.
